tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/6359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/ngbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-12-31T08:04:26Z","milestone":{"title":"needsTriage"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/3704353924","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/66286#issuecomment-3704353924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/66286","id":3704353924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAXExC87cy_SE","user":{"login":"Yourakhere","id":139471330,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFAp4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139471330?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere","html_url":"https://github.com/Yourakhere","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-02T02:37:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T07:19:40Z","body":"Variables are generated in the pipeline by inserting references to all symbols within the scope and later cleaning up unused ones during an optimization pass. When generating the scope for listener instructions, we expose all @let declarations in the same view, which leads to the generation of ɵɵrestoreView and ɵɵresetView calls. However, if an @let reference is not used within the listener, the variable optimization phase removes only the variable that reads it, but not the corresponding ɵɵrestoreView and ɵɵresetView calls.\n\nFor example, consider the following template:\n\n@let unused = 1;\n<button (click)=\"noop()\"></button>\n\n\nThis produces the following code before optimization:\n\nif (rf & 1) {\n  const _r1 = ɵɵgetCurrentView();\n  ɵɵdeclareLet(0);\n  ɵɵdomElementStart(1, \"button\", 0);\n  ɵɵdomListener(\n    \"click\",\n    function TestComp_Template_button_click_1_listener() {\n      const ctx_r1 = ɵɵrestoreView(_r1);\n      const unused_r3 = ɵɵreadContextLet(0);\n      return ɵɵresetView(ctx.noop());\n    }\n  );\n  ɵɵdomElementEnd();\n}\nif (rf & 2) {\n  const unused_r4 = ɵɵstoreLet(1);\n}\n\n\nAfter optimization, it becomes:\n\nif (rf & 1) {\n  const _r1 = ɵɵgetCurrentView();\n  ɵɵdomElementStart(0, \"button\", 0);\n  ɵɵdomListener(\n    \"click\",\n    function TestComp_Template_button_click_0_listener() {\n      ɵɵrestoreView(_r1);\n      return ɵɵresetView(ctx.noop());\n    }\n  );\n  ɵɵdomElementEnd();\n}\nif (rf & 2) {\n  1;\n}\n\n\nThe ɵɵrestoreView and ɵɵresetView calls are unnecessary and should be removed, since there are no reads of the unused @let variable within the listener.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/3704353924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Yourakhere","id":139471330,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFAp4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139471330?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere","html_url":"https://github.com/Yourakhere","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yourakhere/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":21822561869,"node_id":"MEE_lADOAXExC87g19NzzwAAAAUUud5N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/21822561869","actor":{"login":"let","id":53355217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzU1MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53355217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/let","html_url":"https://github.com/let","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let/subscriptions","organizat